 and cousin/extended ties are a faint grey dotted line so inferred kinship visually recedes behind recorded facts."}, {"id": "templates_index_progressive_disclosure", "label": "Progressive Disclosure Landing-to-App Flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "templates/index.html", "source_location": "27-229", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One HTML document holds both a marketing-style hero landing view and the working explorer; the app section stays hidden until a citizen is selected, and a back button returns to the hero. This avoids a second page load and lets the D3 canvas and its cached graph state survive navigation between the two views."}, {"id": "templates_index_search_timing_feedback", "label": "Search Progress and Timing Feedback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "templates/index.html", "source_location": "112-123", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A progress bar reading 'Searching across 50,00,000 records...' plus a post-search elapsed-time readout make the sub-second Neo4j lookup legible as a search over the full 5-million-record corpus, backing the advertised sub-0.5s average query time stat."}], "edges": [{"source": "templates_index_page", "target": "templates_index_herosection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "templates/index.html", "source_location": "28", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "templates_index_page", "target": "templates_index_relfindersection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "templates/index.html", "source_location": "129", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "templates_index_page", "target": "templates_index_inheritorssection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "templates/index.html", "source_location": "162", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "t